  "totalBlocks": 98,
  "translatedBlocks": 85,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a5c0b5824ec2cb2",
      "translationZh": "更新（29/08/2023）：本文新增了 H100 的基准测试。此外，所有性能数据均已使用更新版本的软件重新测定。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d019353288457c9f",
      "translationZh": "在微调先进的视觉语言模型 BridgeTower 时，运行于 Habana Gaudi2 上的 Optimum Habana v1.7 相较于 A100 实现了 x2.5 的加速，相较于 H100 实现了 x1.4 的加速。这一性能提升依赖于硬件加速的数据加载，以充分发挥设备的性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d7dbe439e1ce90c",
      "translationZh": "这些技术也适用于其他受数据加载限制的工作负载，而许多类型的视觉模型经常面临这种情况。本文将带你了解我们用于比较在 Habana Gaudi2、Nvidia H100 和 Nvidia A100 80GB 上微调 BridgeTower 的流程和基准测试，同时展示在基于 transformers 的模型中利用这些功能有多么简单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83ebb7d5dd9241e2",
      "translationZh": "近年来，视觉语言（VL）模型的重要性大幅提升，并在多种 VL 任务中展现出主导优势。最常见的方法是利用单模态编码器，从各自的模态中提取表征。随后，这些表征要么被融合在一起，要么被输入跨模态编码器。为了有效应对 VL 表征学习中的一些性能瓶颈和限制，BridgeTower 引入了多个桥接层，将单模态编码器的顶层与跨模态编码器的每一层连接起来。这使得跨模态编码器中不同语义层级的视觉表征与文本表征能够自底向上进行有效的跨模态对齐与融合。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "451a011393d72642",
      "translationZh": "BridgeTower 仅使用 4M 张图像进行预训练（详见下文），便在各种下游视觉语言任务上达到了最先进的性能。具体而言，BridgeTower 在 VQAv2 test-std 集上达到了 78.73% 的准确率，在使用相同预训练数据、且额外参数量和计算成本几乎可以忽略不计的情况下，比此前最先进的模型（METER）高出 1.09%。值得注意的是，进一步扩大模型规模后，BridgeTower 的准确率达到了 81.15%，超越了那些使用大数个数量级的数据集进行预训练的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7975300f01bc46f8",
      "translationZh": "硬件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c98b7ef16eb8c7bb",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA H100 Tensor Core GPU 是最新、速度最快的一代 Nvidia GPU。它包含专用的 Transformer Engine，支持执行 fp8 混合精度运行。单个设备配备 80GB 内存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aaf5b455807acfdf",
      "translationZh": "Nvidia A100 Tensor Core GPU 采用了第 3 代 Tensor Core 技术。这仍然是你在大多数云服务提供商那里能找到的最快的 GPU。我们在这里使用的是 80GB 显存版本，它提供的显存带宽也比 40GB 版本更高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d04bcebee9c2a4d0",
      "translationZh": "Habana Gaudi2 是 Habana Labs 设计的第二代 AI 硬件加速器。单台服务器包含 8 个称为 HPU 的加速设备，每个设备配备 96GB 内存。请参阅我们之前的博客文章，了解更深入的介绍，以及如何通过 Intel Developer Cloud 访问它的指南。与市面上许多 AI 加速器不同，借助 Optimum Habana，你可以非常轻松地应用高级功能，充分发挥 Gaudi2 的性能；它让用户只需修改 2 行代码，就能将兼容 Transformers 的脚本移植到 Gaudi。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1fa330e271ba9b77",
      "translationZh": "基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64fedf0f2252cb35",
      "translationZh": "为了对训练进行基准测试，我们将微调一个包含 866M 个参数的 BridgeTower Large 检查点。该检查点使用 Conceptual Captions、SBU Captions、MSCOCO Captions 和 Visual Genome 数据集，通过掩码语言建模、图文匹配和图文对比损失，进行了英语预训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "551f29d9882b174a",
      "translationZh": "我们将使用 New Yorker Caption Contest 数据集进一步微调这个检查点，该数据集包含《纽约客》的漫画及得票最多的配文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a981b67e59f6b21f",
      "translationZh": "所有加速器的超参数都相同。我们为每个设备使用的批大小为 48 个样本。你可以在这里查看 Gaudi2 的超参数，在那里查看 A100 的超参数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21c917f6a517e93e",
      "translationZh": "处理包含图像的数据集时，数据加载经常成为瓶颈，因为许多开销很大的操作都在 CPU 上计算（图像解码、图像增强），随后再将完整图像发送到训练设备。理想情况下，我们希望只向设备发送原始字节，然后在设备上执行解码和各种图像变换。不过，让我们先看看如何轻松地为数据加载分配更多资源，以加快运行速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c3f641fcd30fdbbd",
      "translationZh": "利用 dataloader_num_workers",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c61ff89f9a209ec",
      "translationZh": "当图像加载在 CPU 上进行时，一种快速提速的方法是分配更多子进程来加载数据。使用 Transformers 的 TrainingArguments（或其在 Optimum Habana 中的对应版本 GaudiTrainingArguments）可以非常轻松地做到这一点：你可以使用 dataloader_num_workers=N 参数，设置在 CPU 上分配用于数据加载的子进程数量（N）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84f2f0e6c962212c",
      "translationZh": "默认值为 0，表示数据在主进程中加载。这可能不是最优选择，因为主进程有许多事情需要处理。我们可以将其设置为 1，以便使用一个完全专用于数据加载的子进程。分配多个子进程时，每个子进程都负责准备一个批次。这意味着 RAM 消耗会随着工作进程数量的增加而增加。一种建议是将其设置为 CPU 核心数，但这些核心可能并非完全空闲，因此你需要通过尝试来找到最佳配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "195e8f1c6a3dcfc8",
      "translationZh": "我们来运行以下三个实验：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8eea460bc63c4e7e",
      "translationZh": "在 8 个设备上分布式运行混合精度（bfloat16/float32）任务，数据加载与其他所有工作由同一个进程执行（即 dataloader_num_workers=0）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6a56b7c84c318e5d",
      "translationZh": "在 8 个设备上分布式运行混合精度（bfloat16/float32）任务，使用 1 个专用子进程加载数据（即 dataloader_num_workers=1）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ceada5f766d7989b",
      "translationZh": "运行相同任务，但设置 dataloader_num_workers=2",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9f8a86e502393d4",
      "translationZh": "以下是我们在 Gaudi2、H100 和 A100 上获得的吞吐量：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ba0bdeccb426d7b",
      "translationZh": "设备",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0367c829bcf22c89",
      "translationZh": "601.5 样本/秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12b6dd12fd7af442",
      "translationZh": "747.4 样本/秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7c5d57d6674d045",
      "translationZh": "768.7 样本/秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1a4070fa8e12372",
      "translationZh": "336.5 样本/秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19e708ae92964874",
      "translationZh": "580.1 样本/秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efb09e38b1924ad8",
      "translationZh": "602.1 样本/秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71d7e6318a01d125",
      "translationZh": "227.5 样本/秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0369c273db4dd4f",
      "translationZh": "339.7 样本/秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3bf1fe2f8ca4c885",
      "translationZh": "345.4 样本/秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b87203375c9e99d4",
      "translationZh": "首先我们看到，在 dataloader_num_workers=2 时，Gaudi2 的速度是 H100 的 1.28 倍；在 dataloader_num_workers=1 时，是 H100 的 1.29 倍；在 dataloader_num_workers=0 时，是 H100 的 1.79 倍。Gaudi2 也比上一代快得多：在 dataloader_num_workers=2 时，其速度是 A100 的 2.23 倍；在 dataloader_num_workers=1 时，是 A100 的 2.20 倍；在 dataloader_num_workers=0 时，是 A100 的 2.64 倍。这甚至超过了我们此前报告的加速比！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b4f9c1729b035c3",
      "translationZh": "其次，我们发现，为数据加载分配更多资源就能轻松提速：Gaudi2 上的加速比为 x1.28，H100 上为 x1.79，A100 上为 x1.52。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c35f1e8ce295444",
      "translationZh": "我们还尝试使用多个专门负责数据加载的子进程进行实验，但在所有加速器上，性能都没有优于 dataloader_num_workers=2 时的表现。因此，对于涉及图像的运行任务，使用 dataloader_num_workers>0 通常是一个不错的初步加速方法！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a87ec4a8180eb12",
      "translationZh": "Gaudi2 的 Tensorboard 日志可在此处以可视化方式查看，A100 的日志则可在彼处查看。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7b4bea2241274be6",
      "translationZh": "使用 Optimum Habana 实现硬件加速的数据加载",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4939f9b3ced2566e",
      "translationZh": "为了实现更大幅度的提速，我们现在要将尽可能多的数据加载操作从 CPU 转移到加速器设备上（即 Gaudi2 上的 HPU 或 A100/H100 上的 GPU）。在 Gaudi2 上，可以使用 Habana 的媒体流水线来实现这一点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d7fada99dda3b51",
      "translationZh": "对于给定的数据集，大多数数据加载器都遵循以下流程：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d7e3f6b7cc525937",
      "translationZh": "获取数据（例如，从磁盘上存储 JPEG 图像的位置获取）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f0a60e02e93af4a6",
      "translationZh": "CPU 读取编码后的图像",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "968e270114cc6609",
      "translationZh": "CPU 对图像进行解码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "616fc1b4582151ab",
      "translationZh": "CPU 通过图像变换来进行图像增强",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9f38b413bac2d40b",
      "translationZh": "最后，将图像发送到设备（不过，这通常不是由数据加载器本身完成的）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fc0481acc6adf77",
      "translationZh": "与其在 CPU 上完成整个流程，再将可直接用于训练的数据发送到设备，不如采用一种更高效的工作流程：先将编码后的图像发送到设备，然后再进行图像解码和增强：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2ca6681525462721",
      "translationZh": "与之前相同",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2ca6681525462721",
      "translationZh": "与之前相同",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "13f3e235707da28e",
      "translationZh": "将编码后的图像发送到设备",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "17af5d39615da5ee",
      "translationZh": "设备对图像进行解码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "98f39feed8d371d6",
      "translationZh": "设备通过应用图像变换来进行图像增强",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f58ce64619283a14",
      "translationZh": "这样，我们就能利用设备的计算能力，加快图像解码和变换的速度。请注意，这样做时有两点需要留意：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "34a44ae104dc643b",
      "translationZh": "设备内存占用会增加，因此，如果可用内存不足，你可能需要减小批次大小。这可能会削弱这种方法带来的加速效果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cd747de2f9b20a59",
      "translationZh": "如果在 CPU 上进行数据加载时，设备的利用率已经很高（达到或接近 100%），那么将数据加载放到设备上也不会带来加速，因为它们已经满负荷运转了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df24e6c3f88c14b7",
      "translationZh": "要在 Gaudi2 上实现这一点，我们已经为你做好了准备：Optimum Habana 中的对比式图文示例现在提供了一个开箱即用的媒体流水线，可用于包含文本和图像的 COCO 类数据集！你只需在命令中添加 --mediapipe_dataloader 即可使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e9485f3fce36252",
      "translationZh": "感兴趣的读者可以在此处的 Gaudi 文档中查看更底层的概述，并在彼处查看所有受支持算子的列表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b6fa93f53bea2dd",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们将添加 mediapipe_dataloader 参数，重新运行之前的实验，因为它与 dataloader_num_workers 兼容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ba0bdeccb426d7b",
      "translationZh": "设备",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0367c829bcf22c89",
      "translationZh": "601.5 样本/秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7c5d57d6674d045",
      "translationZh": "768.7 样本/秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04dbee6c939269c4",
      "translationZh": "847.7 样本/秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1a4070fa8e12372",
      "translationZh": "336.5 样本/秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efb09e38b1924ad8",
      "translationZh": "602.1 样本/秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71d7e6318a01d125",
      "translationZh": "227.5 样本/秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3bf1fe2f8ca4c885",
      "translationZh": "345.4 样本/秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f00e37837c14ff9",
      "translationZh": "与上一次仅设置 dataloader_num_workers=2 的运行相比，我们又获得了 x1.10 的加速。因此，仅添加 2 个开箱即用的训练参数，这次最终运行的速度就达到了我们在 Gaudi2 上基准运行的 x1.41。在同样设置 dataloader_num_workers=2 的情况下，其速度也是 H100 的 x1.41、A100 的 x2.45！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a373fedf35d1a420",
      "translationZh": "复现此基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c307b63815d5af58",
      "translationZh": "要复现此基准测试，首先需要通过 Intel Developer Cloud 获得 Gaudi2 的使用权限（更多信息请参阅此指南）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21f8ba51208e65d3",
      "translationZh": "然后，你需要安装最新版本的 Optimum Habana，并运行 run_bridgetower.py，你可以在这里找到该脚本。具体操作如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f6b869a12c8a267",
      "translationZh": "运行该脚本的基本命令行为：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "44fbcfcf1bcceba4",
      "translationZh": "这对应于 --dataloader_num_workers 0 的情况。然后，你可以添加 --dataloader_num_workers N 和 --mediapipe_dataloader 来测试其他配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e85495895c24cbb",
      "translationZh": "要将模型和 Tensorboard 日志推送到 Hugging Face Hub，你需要事先使用以下命令登录你的账户：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5eb198e1228f764",
      "translationZh": "对于 A100 和 H100，你可以使用同一个 run_bridgetower.py 脚本，只需做几处小改动：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "924ef114c4850392",
      "translationZh": "将 GaudiTrainer 和 GaudiTrainingArguments 替换为 Transformers 中的 Trainer 和 TrainingArguments",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "de127ec248f05a70",
      "translationZh": "移除对 GaudiConfig、gaudi_config 和 HabanaDataloaderTrainer 的引用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "90b57ecf0b9db256",
      "translationZh": "直接从 Transformers 导入 set_seed：from transformers import set_seed",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12edc8fb5682c6ce",
      "translationZh": "本基准测试中展示的结果是在一个配备 8 个设备的 Nvidia H100 Lambda 实例和一个配备 8 个设备的 Nvidia A100 80GB GCP 实例上，使用 Nvidia 的 Docker 镜像获得的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c2574dc138f1dd4",
      "translationZh": "请注意，--mediapipe_dataloader 仅兼容 Gaudi2，无法在 A100/H100 上使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "781dc500b3b30191",
      "translationZh": "关于在 H100 上使用 Transformer Engine 的 fp8 结果，目前尚无法提供，因为代码会崩溃，而且需要修改 Transformers 中 BridgeTower 的模型实现。待 Gaudi2 支持 fp8 时，我们会重新进行这项比较。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a4f1b06057e0e52",
      "translationZh": "在处理图像时，我们介绍了两种加快训练工作流程的方案：为数据加载器分配更多资源，以及直接在加速器设备上而非 CPU 上对图像进行解码和增强。我们展示了这些方法在训练 BridgeTower 这样的最先进（SOTA）视觉语言模型时，能够带来显著的速度提升：使用 Optimum Habana 的 Habana Gaudi2，其速度约为使用 Transformers 的 Nvidia H100 的 x1.4 倍、Nvidia A100 80GB 的 x2.5 倍！而且使用起来极其简单，只需额外提供几个训练参数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "167c6d417f0bb02d",
      "translationZh": "为了进一步提升性能，我们期待使用 HPU graphs 来更快地训练模型，并介绍如何在 Gaudi2 上使用 DeepSpeed ZeRO-3 加速 LLM 的训练。敬请期待！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b8aaecfc256b7ec",
      "translationZh": "如果你有兴趣利用最新的 AI 硬件加速器和软件库来加速机器学习训练与推理工作流程，请了解我们的 Expert Acceleration Program。如需进一步了解 Habana 解决方案，请阅读有关我们合作关系的介绍，并在此处联系他们。如需进一步了解 Hugging Face 为降低 AI 硬件加速器使用门槛所做的努力，请了解我们的 Hardware Partner Program。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "aea370bca4ee9e70",
      "translationZh": "相关主题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e956b887c0522858",
      "translationZh": "更快的训练与推理：Habana Gaudi-2 对比 Nvidia A100 80GB",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "120e4539264aadfa",
      "translationZh": "大型语言模型的快速推理：在 Habana Gaudi2 加速器上运行 BLOOMZ",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
